<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>FraudLens — AI Powered Fraud Detection</title>

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&family=Syne:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #080a0f;
            --surface: #0f1117;
            --surface2: #161b24;
            --border: #1e2433;
            --border2: #2a3347;
            --text: #e2e8f0;
            --muted: #64748b;
            --accent: #00e5b0;
            --danger: #ff3d5a;
            --warning: #ffaa00;
            --mono: 'Space Mono', monospace;
            --display: 'Syne', sans-serif;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            background: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            font-family: var(--display);
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Dot grid background */
        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,229,176,0.06) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 32px 32px;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        /* Glow blobs */
        .blob1 {
            position: fixed;
            width: 600px; height: 600px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,229,176,0.06) 0%, transparent 70%);
            top: -200px; left: -200px;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
        }
        .blob2 {
            position: fixed;
            width: 500px; height: 500px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,61,90,0.05) 0%, transparent 70%);
            bottom: -100px; right: -100px;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 0;
        }

        /* ── NAVBAR ── */
        .fl-navbar {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            background: rgba(8,10,15,0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 0 2rem;
            height: 60px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }
        .fl-brand {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent);
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            text-decoration: none;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .fl-brand .dot {
            width: 8px; height: 8px;
            background: var(--accent);
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%,100% { opacity:1; transform:scale(1); }
            50% { opacity:0.4; transform:scale(0.8); }
        }
        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            list-style: none;
        }
        .nav-links a {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 0.68rem;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }
        .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); border-color: rgba(0,229,176,0.2); background: rgba(0,229,176,0.05); }
        .nav-links .btn-primary-nav {
            background: var(--accent);
            color: #000 !important;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-color: var(--accent) !important;
        }
        .nav-links .btn-primary-nav:hover { background: #00c99a; }

        /* ── HERO ── */
        .hero {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 6rem 2rem 4rem;
        }

        .hero-tag {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 0.65rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--accent);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,176,0.25);
            background: rgba(0,229,176,0.05);
            padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 99px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            animation: fadeUp 0.6s ease both;
        }
        .hero-tag .live-dot {
            width: 6px; height: 6px;
            background: var(--accent);
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.1;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            animation: fadeUp 0.6s 0.1s ease both;
        }
        .hero-title .accent { color: var(--accent); }
        .hero-title .danger { color: var(--danger); }

        .hero-sub {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--muted);
            max-width: 560px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            animation: fadeUp 0.6s 0.2s ease both;
        }

        .hero-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            animation: fadeUp 0.6s 0.3s ease both;
        }

        .btn-hero-primary {
            background: var(--accent);
            color: #000;
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 0.85rem 2.2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            border: none;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }
        .btn-hero-primary:hover {
            background: #00c99a;
            color: #000;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0,229,176,0.25);
        }

        .btn-hero-outline {
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--text);
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 0.85rem 2.2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border: 1px solid var(--border2);
            transition: all 0.2s;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }
        .btn-hero-outline:hover {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            color: var(--accent);
            background: rgba(0,229,176,0.05);
        }

        /* Stats bar */
        .stats-bar {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 3rem;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: rgba(15,17,23,0.8);
            animation: fadeUp 0.6s 0.4s ease both;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .stat-item { text-align: center; }
        .stat-item .num {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent);
            display: block;
        }
        .stat-item .lbl {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 0.6rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        /* ── FEATURES ── */
        .section {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            padding: 5rem 2rem;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .section-tag {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 0.62rem;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--accent);
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        .section-sub {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            max-width: 500px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.2rem;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1.8rem;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: transform 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
        }
        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            border-color: var(--border2);
        }
        .feature-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            height: 2px;
        }
        .feature-card.green::before  { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), transparent); }
        .feature-card.red::before    { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--danger), transparent); }
        .feature-card.yellow::before { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--warning), transparent); }
        .feature-card.blue::before   { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0066ff, transparent); }

        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .feature-title {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .feature-desc {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            line-height: 1.65;
        }

        /* ── HOW IT WORKS ── */
        .steps-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            counter-reset: steps;
        }
        .step-card {
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1.8rem;
            position: relative;
        }
        .step-num {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 0.65rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: var(--accent);
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        }
        .step-title {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        .step-desc {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* ── CTA ── */
        .cta-section {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 5rem 2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: var(--surface);
        }
        .cta-title {
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        .cta-sub {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        /* ── FOOTER ── */
        .fl-footer {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            font-family: var(--mono);
            font-size: 0.65rem;
            color: var(--muted);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .fl-footer span { color: var(--accent); }

        @keyframes fadeUp {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .hero-title { letter-spacing: -1px; }
            .stats-bar { gap: 1.5rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="blob1"></div>
<div class="blob2"></div>

<!-- NAVBAR -->
<nav class="fl-navbar">
    <a href="/" class="fl-brand">
        <span class="dot"></span>
        FraudLens
    </a>
    <ul class="nav-links">
        <li><a href="/applications">Applications</a></li>
        <li><a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a></li>
        <% if (currUser) { %>
            <li><a href="/applications/new" class="btn-primary-nav">Apply Now</a></li>
            <li><a href="/logout" style="color:var(--muted);">Logout</a></li>
        <% } else { %>
            <li><a href="/login">Login</a></li>
            <li><a href="/signup" class="btn-primary-nav">Sign Up</a></li>
        <% } %>
    </ul>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-tag">
        <span class="live-dot"></span>
        AI-Powered • Blockchain-Secured • Real-Time
    </div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">
        Detect Fraud.<br>
        <span class="accent">Protect</span> Welfare.<br>
        <span class="danger">Stop</span> Schemes.
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">
        FraudLens uses AI document verification, behavioral analysis, and blockchain audit trails to prevent fraud in government welfare schemes.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/applications/new" class="btn-hero-primary">
            🛡️ Apply for Scheme
        </a>
        <a href="/dashboard" class="btn-hero-outline">
            📊 View Dashboard
        </a>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- STATS BAR -->
<div class="stats-bar">
    <div class="stat-item">
        <span class="num">99.2%</span>
        <span class="lbl">Detection Accuracy</span>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item">
        <span class="num">5+</span>
        <span class="lbl">Welfare Schemes</span>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item">
        <span class="num">&lt;2s</span>
        <span class="lbl">AI Verify Time</span>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item">
        <span class="num">100%</span>
        <span class="lbl">Blockchain Audit</span>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- FEATURES -->
<div class="section">
    <p class="section-tag">Core Capabilities</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Built to catch every type of fraud</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">From duplicate identities to sophisticated syndicates — FraudLens covers it all.</p>

    <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card green">
            <div class="feature-icon">🤖</div>
            <div class="feature-title">AI Document Verification</div>
            <div class="feature-desc">Uploaded Aadhaar and PAN cards are scanned by AI to detect tampering, forgery, and mismatched numbers in real-time.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card red">
            <div class="feature-icon">🧠</div>
            <div class="feature-title">Behavioral Fraud Scoring</div>
            <div class="feature-desc">Every application gets a 0–100 composite fraud score based on submission speed, timing, IP patterns, and identity signals.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card yellow">
            <div class="feature-icon">🕸️</div>
            <div class="feature-title">Syndicate Detection</div>
            <div class="feature-desc">Graph-based identity clustering detects fraud rings where multiple fake identities share the same phone, IP, or device.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card blue">
            <div class="feature-icon">🔗</div>
            <div class="feature-title">Blockchain Audit Trail</div>
            <div class="feature-desc">Every application is hashed and recorded on a tamper-evident blockchain ledger — creating an immutable evidence trail.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card green">
            <div class="feature-icon">🗺️</div>
            <div class="feature-title">Cross-Scheme Detection</div>
            <div class="feature-desc">Checks if an applicant has already enrolled in another welfare scheme — preventing double-dipping across PMAY, PM-KISAN, MGNREGA and more.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card red">
            <div class="feature-icon">📋</div>
            <div class="feature-title">Explainable Verdicts</div>
            <div class="feature-desc">Every fraud flag comes with a human-readable evidence trail showing exactly which signals triggered the alert — no black box.</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
<div style="background:var(--surface);border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);">
    <div class="section">
        <p class="section-tag">How It Works</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">From submission to verdict in seconds</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">A multi-layered pipeline runs automatically on every application.</p>

        <div class="steps-grid">
            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="step-num">STEP 01</div>
                <div class="step-title">Submit Application</div>
                <div class="step-desc">Applicant fills the form with personal details, selects a welfare scheme, and uploads Aadhaar + PAN documents.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="step-num">STEP 02</div>
                <div class="step-title">AI Document Scan</div>
                <div class="step-desc">AI verifies document authenticity, checks for tampering, and confirms the numbers match what was entered.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="step-num">STEP 03</div>
                <div class="step-title">Fraud Score Engine</div>
                <div class="step-desc">9 behavioral and identity signals are evaluated to generate a 0–100 fraud score with detailed reasons.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="step-num">STEP 04</div>
                <div class="step-title">Blockchain Record</div>
                <div class="step-desc">The application and its verdict are hashed and permanently recorded on the blockchain audit ledger.</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- CTA -->
<div class="cta-section">
    <h2 class="cta-title">Ready to apply for a scheme?</h2>
    <p class="cta-sub">Submit your application securely. Legitimate applications are processed instantly.</p>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:1rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <a href="/applications/new" class="btn-hero-primary">🛡️ Apply Now</a>
        <a href="/signup" class="btn-hero-outline">Create Account →</a>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- FOOTER -->
<footer class="fl-footer">
    <span>⬡ FRAUDLENS</span> — AI-Powered Government Scheme Integrity System &nbsp;|&nbsp; VOIS Tech Innovation Marathon 2.0
</footer>

</body>
</html>
